  'La unidad ha cambiado después de compilar esto. Lo que se ve es de antes del cambio.': 'The unit has changed since this was built. What you see is from before the change.',
  'La usa 1 documento, y no hay que tocarlo: la nombra por su id, que no cambia.': '1 document uses it, and it doesn\'t need touching: it names the lesson by its id, which doesn\'t change.',
  'La usan {0} documentos, y no hay que tocar ninguno: la nombran por su id, que no cambia.': '{0} documents use it, and none of them needs touching: they name the lesson by its id, which doesn\'t change.',
