  'Tiene {0}. Si mandas la carpeta a la Papelera, ese trabajo se va con ella.': 'It has {0}. If you move the folder to the Trash, that work goes with it.',
  'Tienes cambios sin enviar, y en GitHub han entrado otros que tocan lo mismo. Didacta lo ha dejado todo como estaba --lo tuyo sigue guardado en tu ordenador--; juntarlos es cosa de git, a mano.': 'You have unsent changes, and others have arrived on GitHub that touch the same thing. Didacta has left everything as it was --your work is still saved on your computer--; combining them is a job for git, by hand.',
